# GCC Financial Planning & Analysis Dashboard

## Overview
An interactive Power BI project analysing financial performance, budget variance, and profitability across GCC entities.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- DAX measures
- Microsoft Excel
- Data modelling and visualisation

## Dashboard Pages
1. Executive Summary
2. P&L Variance Analysis
3. Entity & Department Analysis
4. Financial Insights & Recommendations

## Key Findings
- Operations had the largest unfavourable budget variance in the analysed dataset.
- Oman had the highest EBITDA margin among the entities.

## Business Recommendations
- Investigate the drivers of unfavourable variance in Operations.
- Compare entity-level cost structures and profitability.
- Monitor budget performance and margins regularly.

## Project File
Open `GCC_Financial_Analysis_PowerBI.pbix` in Power BI Desktop to explore the report.

## Disclaimer
This project is for learning and portfolio purposes. Findings reflect the dataset used in the report.
